Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["From a Sullivan Model to an IBL Algebra", "Title",
 CellID->509267359,ExpressionUUID->"4ddb5767-1f00-4973-a411-49eacd07850d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The dIBL algebra of a closed oriented ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["n", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "b18e4238-5e63-4805-873e-8f7f9a0fe23a"],
 "-manifold ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["X", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "b9d4941d-cfd1-4b4e-bb93-e3ade56db25e"],
 " lives on the cyclic words of a graded alphabet, and the alphabet is a \
basis of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["H", "TI"], "*"], "(", 
    StyleBox["X", "TI"], ")"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"1d515b26-973d-4933-bece-779677b310b6"],
 " shifted by one, with the pairing that Poincar\[EAcute] duality gives it. \
This tutorial builds that alphabet without ever mentioning ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["X", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "a18c7fcc-9c37-441b-8cd3-e765b07f1023"],
 ": it starts from a Sullivan minimal model, puts the natural orientation on \
it, checks that the resulting oriented PDGA is of Hodge type, passes to the \
nondegenerate quotient, and reads the canonical Maurer-Cartan element off the \
triple product of the quotient. The running example is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["CP",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "2"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"91716dc4-481e-427f-a59b-ec4b30d3f8b5"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e46283ee-6867-43b3-8bec-0da5e2b592c4"],

Cell["Five steps, and each one is a single function.", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"eba188cd-66d2-48e5-9244-01a1234b1a56"],

Cell["The minimal model", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"05171924-a64e-4e43-86f0-896fb5e243e7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A Sullivan minimal model is a free graded commutative algebra ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[CapitalLambda]", 
    StyleBox["U", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "524d0fd9-ad2d-4fc4-85bc-e38575acc4c7"],
 " with a differential. For ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["CP",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["m", "TI"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "18a98fd1-4e70-47c5-99ac-6e327c605cf6"],
 " it has two generators: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["a", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "24675ddc-ce3b-464c-aa19-14070ea20a99"],
 " in degree ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["2", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "647ee094-2816-404e-bb0c-3536ce2adf2b"],
 " with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["d",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", "0"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"8e4b3a88-4648-4463-bc29-5dee7ed226f5"],
 ", and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["b", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "f97cc90e-4837-4388-8be9-82162075cd0f"],
 " in degree ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"2", 
    StyleBox["m", "TI"], "+", "1"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"d8cbf0da-0690-4ad2-bed2-704c0bbb61bc"],
 " with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["d",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["b", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["a", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["m", "TI"], "+", "1"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"29db8446-7bbf-4be7-9efa-c1412f8e57e2"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"cac9298b-c0b0-4767-bf86-af4417a23a5c"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"model", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"SullivanModel", "[", 
    RowBox[{"\"\<ComplexProjectiveSpace\>\"", "[", "2", "]"}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"Normal", "[", 
  RowBox[{"model", "[", "\"\<Generators\>\"", "]"}], "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"e32c4e52-f4e9-4fca-ab1d-688fe8fd34bf"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"a", "\[Rule]", "2"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"b", "\[Rule]", "5"}]}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[1]= ",ExpressionUUID->"6f154649-a88c-479d-9bf1-710f8ad9bb2d"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
The differential is stored on the generators and extended as a derivation. It \
raises degree by one:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4d4bfbcb-d09c-4e2a-874a-d15d99899fff"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"SullivanModelDifferential", "[", 
    RowBox[{"b", ",", " ", "model"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"SullivanModelDifferential", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"a", " ", "b"}], ",", " ", "model"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[2]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"18676ee5-22ec-4b3c-8e06-8aa2af603b1a"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox["a", "3"], ",", 
   SuperscriptBox["a", "4"]}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[2]= ",ExpressionUUID->"f024998a-013f-4d6f-8139-739f4cca8496"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A monomial is written as a product of generators, read in the order the \
model declares them. ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["SullivanModelBasis"]], 
    "paclet:ChernSimons/ref/SullivanModelBasis", "ChernSimons Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "13eec9d7-7583-494a-8a91-f2a936c67d8b"],
 " lists the monomials of one degree; the algebra is infinite-dimensional, \
one or two monomials in every degree from here up."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0038500e-dccb-4b3f-8a4a-9018484b284a"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"SullivanModelBasis", "[", 
    RowBox[{"model", ",", " ", "k"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"k", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "8"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[3]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"d768a085-543a-46c5-8790-9416b63d803d"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", "1", "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", "a", "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    SuperscriptBox["a", "2"], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", "b", "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    SuperscriptBox["a", "3"], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"a", " ", "b"}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    SuperscriptBox["a", "4"], "}"}]}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[3]= ",ExpressionUUID->"98670676-1943-432e-97fe-6cce36b6ed8b"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["The orientation, and the pairing it defines", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"031cf923-25a0-4f40-964e-6eb952d09afb"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The cohomology of this model is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["R",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"[", 
     StyleBox["a", "TI"], "]"}], "/", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     SuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["a", "TI"], "3"], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"72d098bf-036f-4057-95ab-a5f7a1fcc848"],
 ", so the top class is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["a", "TI"], "2"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"4f08a0c0-590b-4e10-8b59-8245e9423d6f"],
 " in degree ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["4", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "b743f336-e095-48af-8f30-1328b8859945"],
 ". Let the orientation ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["O", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "bb11a672-58bb-4058-81b1-382b8021184e"],
 " be the coefficient of that monomial: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["1", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "2f456833-44bb-4f40-8e63-58904be1d7d8"],
 " on ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["a", "TI"], "2"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"65f20c44-e93a-46c9-a533-7629b829e73d"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["0", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "419b4517-d8c1-480d-a124-1909ccbbea47"],
 " on everything else. That is what ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"model", "[", "\"\<Orientation\>\"", "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"51f31607-b62f-448b-bddc-c1c0ee04cd06"],
 " records, as its values on the monomials of degree ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["4", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "78e57a9c-46ee-4ac4-aa0f-4129185c0ec4"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7441eaf4-a072-447c-870a-33de25d489b3"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"model", "[", "\"\<Orientation\>\"", "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"model", "[", "\"\<Degree\>\"", "]"}]}], "}"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[4]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"71be69f0-5c9d-4e9b-8f7d-710c3500b4aa"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", 
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox["a", "2"], "\[Rule]", "1"}], "\[RightAssociation]"}], ",",
    "4"}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[4]= ",ExpressionUUID->"b2fabb6a-f9d0-47b0-9b7a-074bb6fa4e42"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["SullivanModelOrientation"]], 
    "paclet:ChernSimons/ref/SullivanModelOrientation", 
    "ChernSimons Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "d741d1a0-35a7-44b2-90da-2336d2101268"],
 " applies it. Everything outside degree ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["4", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "2a8017b9-1162-4561-81d6-5a3a405fc01e"],
 " is killed, and inside degree ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["4", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "fb29bb1f-aadc-4dab-8d18-c063ca1e1af2"],
 " only ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["a", "TI"], "2"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"0d751993-bbec-4999-8cd6-7d99fae0a28c"],
 " survives:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"07daaadb-d72f-486c-9a0b-2f24b0ded8d8"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"SullivanModelOrientation", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"a", "^", "2"}], ",", " ", "model"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"SullivanModelOrientation", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"a", "^", "3"}], ",", " ", "model"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"SullivanModelOrientation", "[", 
    RowBox[{"b", ",", " ", "model"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[5]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"f35cd63f-3996-45c2-ab56-da26028c05ba"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{"1", ",", "0", ",", "0"}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[5]= ",ExpressionUUID->"73fe7a46-060d-44e2-825e-c8bb21fb95af"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The pairing is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAngleBracket]", 
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["v", "TI"], "1"], ",", 
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["v", "TI"], "2"]}], "\[RightAngleBracket]"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
    
    StyleBox["O", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["v", "TI"], "1"], 
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["v", "TI"], "2"]}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"a3410e1f-668b-42d2-8917-08e3ca25d0ab"],
 ", the orientation of the product. On ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"1", ",", 
    StyleBox["a", "TI"], ",", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["a", "TI"], "2"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"7a542e24-d043-415b-b486-6b73d837efb2"],
 " it is the antidiagonal, which is Poincar\[EAcute] duality:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"70af540d-df06-4edf-8016-131a4229d8f3"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"SullivanModelPairing", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"a", "^", "i"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"a", "^", "j"}], ",", " ", "model"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"i", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "2"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"j", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "2"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], " ", "//", 
  " ", "MatrixForm"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[6]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"b32f8df9-475f-4134-b66f-419931f2846b"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[
  RowBox[{"(", "\[NoBreak]", GridBox[{
     {"0", "0", "1"},
     {"0", "1", "0"},
     {"1", "0", "0"}
    },
    GridBoxAlignment->{"Columns" -> {{Center}}, "Rows" -> {{Baseline}}},
    GridBoxSpacings->{"Columns" -> {
        Offset[0.27999999999999997`], {
         Offset[0.7]}, 
        Offset[0.27999999999999997`]}, "Rows" -> {
        Offset[0.2], {
         Offset[0.4]}, 
        Offset[0.2]}}], "\[NoBreak]", ")"}],
  Function[BoxForm`e$, 
   MatrixForm[BoxForm`e$]]]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[6]= ",ExpressionUUID->"ee632733-4d85-4a4f-b6ad-18724d6c7a0a"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "This is an ",
 StyleBox["orientation", "TI"],
 " in the sense of Lambrechts-Stanley: it has degree ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["4", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "2fc2b88c-1924-422c-ab28-50c36c48417b"],
 ", it kills the image of the differential, and it does not vanish on the \
kernel. Together with the perfect pairing it induces on cohomology, that \
makes ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{"\[CapitalLambda]", 
     StyleBox["U", "TI"], ",", 
     StyleBox["d",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], ",", 
     StyleBox["O", "TI"]}], ")"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"26d7bfb6-73cd-4363-ac96-0271647e1a5e"],
 " an oriented PDGA of degree ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["4", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "ba7ec383-77f6-4871-8594-609dd5f25fcc"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"58a2fc81-2f73-491d-a68b-5d411d246ffb"],

Cell["Is it of Hodge type?", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"18ed9ded-36e5-4d61-8ca7-aee7022bab5f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The pairing is ",
 StyleBox["not", "TI"],
 " perfect on chain level: the whole of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[CapitalLambda]", 
    StyleBox["U", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "e2130f72-ad7b-402c-a80d-3f5f01a8647a"],
 " above degree ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["4", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "d5a4ca3d-a627-44d0-9825-6a4f92f6790f"],
 " is paired to zero with everything, because the orientation only sees \
degree ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["4", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "ef3ead58-4607-409e-922d-fb051ddd3936"],
 ". Those elements form the ",
 StyleBox["degenerate subspace", "TI"],
 " ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["V", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["deg",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "5521263d-8960-43bd-bc32-c32ca3a63c7e"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a643c47a-583b-4567-9373-7eeca57ba71d"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"DegenerateSubspace", "[", 
    RowBox[{"model", ",", " ", "5"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"DegenerateSubspace", "[", 
    RowBox[{"model", ",", " ", "6"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"DegenerateSubspace", "[", 
    RowBox[{"model", ",", " ", "7"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[7]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"9c36dcfc-d591-4f5c-9eda-22888bb7282e"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", "b", "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    SuperscriptBox["a", "3"], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"a", " ", "b"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[7]= ",ExpressionUUID->"74435e94-87e9-4892-a361-b98e2aaa651e"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The oriented PDGA is ",
 StyleBox["of Hodge type", "TI"],
 " when it admits a Hodge decomposition ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["V", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["H", "TI"], "\[CirclePlus]", 
    StyleBox["im",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], " ", 
    StyleBox["d",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[CirclePlus]", 
    StyleBox["C", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "cc48c368-2c77-4ec7-bb6a-d50d07c7a83f"],
 " with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["C", "TI"], "\[Perpendicular]", 
    StyleBox["C", "TI"], "\[CirclePlus]", 
    StyleBox["H", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "2f3816d1-0ff9-4d5f-b805-4b065e8f78ad"],
 ". Over a field of characteristic ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[NotEqual]", "2"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"b57e0489-d0ae-431f-8377-e9935191d8ca"],
 " and for a quotient of finite type, that happens exactly when ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["V", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["deg",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "c14fedff-8fb3-43ea-9ed9-b00141751cef"],
 " is acyclic, equivalently exactly when the quotient map onto the \
nondegenerate quotient is a quasi-isomorphism. So the test is one cohomology \
computation."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e4ae1d93-ef9f-4be2-81cc-f3ce3259e096"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"HodgeTypeQ", "[", "model", "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[8]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"b1fc56fe-65d0-4fa7-ab74-0ac8f2550666"],

Cell[BoxData["True"], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[8]= ",ExpressionUUID->"662287a0-9f50-4b9c-9f95-94aace78b843"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["HodgeTypeReport"]], "paclet:ChernSimons/ref/HodgeTypeReport", 
    "ChernSimons Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "5cc67c85-a720-4973-b6ec-62aa31b20ce4"],
 " shows why, degree by degree. The fourth column is the cohomology of the \
degenerate subspace, and it vanishes throughout. Here the second and fifth \
columns agree as well, which says more: the quotient carries no differential, \
so it ",
 StyleBox["is", "TI"],
 " the cohomology: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["CP",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "2"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"19d00b93-8bbf-4e65-b972-858ed6e6b7c7"],
 " is formal. A Hodge-type model whose quotient keeps a differential has ",
 Cell[BoxData[
 "Cohomology"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "6c593cbc-6acd-4fd9-a066-2683de1f1924"],
 " strictly below ",
 Cell[BoxData[
 "Quotient"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "1334e89e-aca7-4259-8c05-0593349c563c"],
 ", and the next tutorial shows one."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f76aac47-dcb1-4843-90b3-21ee7f403a69"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"HodgeTypeReport", "[", "model", "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[9]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"b5e1e18c-836e-4f64-afc2-c42950a78f69"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[
  TagBox[
   DynamicModuleBox[{TypeSystem`NestedGrid`PackagePrivate`$state$$ = <|
